{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;<i>Creej's Corruption</i>&quot;  is a <strong> stealth horror</strong> game which immerses players into the <strong>open world</strong> of Forenious to locate a missing friend. Go up against an <u><strong>AI that learns your tactics and predicts your actions.</strong></u> Every mistake you make is detrimental. Find your friend, and do <strong>NOT</strong> get caught.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/An_AI_that_Predicts_your_moves.png?t=1743313544\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/Gettingchased.gif?t=1743313544\" />The AI in this game is unlike most others. It takes note of <strong>EVERYTHING</strong> you do. Opened the front door and ran upstairs? It has taken note of that. Hid in a closet? It now knows where to check next. Ran around the house once? He will take a faster route next time.  <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/dont_hide_in_the_same_place_twice.png?t=1743313544\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/ClosetCatch.gif?t=1743313544\" />Explore the expansive open world featuring multiple Biomes, Towns, Neighborhoods, and characters who all have their own unique abilities and features. Embark on an 8\u201312-hour main story with lots of side content to find your missing friend! <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/find_your_kidnapped_friend.png?t=1743313544\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/justafewdaysleft3.gif?t=1743313544\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2420700?t=1743313544